      "note": "(task_id, subtask_id) is the combination of columns with unique values for this table.\nEach row in this table indicates that for the task task_id, the subtask with ID subtask_id was executed successfully.\nIt is guaranteed that subtask_id <= subtasks_count for each task_id."
